Make every registered Wayle dropdown opened through the external D-Bus bar hook use
the monitor-local layer window. The shared external host already owns a
transparent click-away backdrop, so audio, battery, Bluetooth, brightness,
calendar, media, notification and weather panels now dismiss on outside clicks
the same way Dashboard and Network do.

